# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the pad path's filter under the live macros, over a held chord at
# Thickness 60: Dark down (closed 2.5 octaves), back, up (opened); then Motion down (the LFO's sweep still) and up
# (+-12 semitones). Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap HOME
turn ALGO 80
set 87 60
wait 600
tapkey 0
wait 1500
wav pad-control.wav
wait 3000
set 86 -100 1500
wait 4000
set 86 0 1500
wait 3000
set 86 100 1500
wait 4000
set 86 0 1500
wait 2000
set 88 -100
wait 5000
set 88 100
wait 8000
wavstop
